      "title": "Trustwave Securities Limited Announces Appointment of Chandni Lohar as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer, Effective February 16, 2026",
      "body": "Trustwave Securities Limited announced the appointment of Ms. Chandni Lohar as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer, effective February 16, 2026. The appointment was made in accordance with Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015. Ms. Chandni Lohar has a strong expertise in corporate governance and regulatory compliance. Experienced in managing board meetings, maintaining statutory records, and ensuring adherence to legal requirements. Skilled in advising directors and upholding high standards of corporate administration and confidentiality. Ms. Chandni Lohar is designated as Key Managerial Personnel of the company. The board meeting to approve the appointment was held on February 16, 2026.",
